# Cursor AI Rules for Explorer

## Context Source Priority
- Always inspect `../orch_ai_strator/context/repomix-output.xml` first for
  backend details.
- Consult the docs in `./docs` for Explorer-specific constraints before
  reading source files.

## Explorer Constraints
- Explorer is read-only: never mutate backend data.
- All data comes from SljivaStore backend APIs described in the docs.
- Use the `/api/explorer/*` routes for search operations.

## Workflow
1. Understand the feature request.
2. Review Explorer docs to capture domain context.
3. Only read or edit files under `explorer/` unless instructed otherwise.

